"Some containers are opened or dumped instead of broken: an Open action reveals/exposes contents without destroying the container (cabinets, chests, racks), and a Dump action spills contents into the room like the death-spill but leaves the container intact and reusable. Breakables stay the third kind. Needs a container-interaction model (which of break/open/dump each container supports) as explicit data, not inferred from appearance."